### Create transaction
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount":"ACC-12345","toAccount":"ACC-67890","amount":"100.50","currency":"USD","type":"transfer"}

### List transactions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Balance
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

